 t Only\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/190021\n\nEmbar
 k on a spirited journey through The 'Quin as we visit five distinct bars d
 uring a progressive beverage experience designed for discovery\, conversat
 ion\, and connection.\n\nThe evening begins at Scottie's\, where members w
 ill gather over light bites before making their way through Café Q\, The 
 Pub\, Fernando's\, and Dive Bar. At each stop\, enjoy a bespoke cocktail o
 r zero proof option crafted exclusively for the occasion\, showcasing the 
 unique character of each space. Beer and wine selections will also be avai
 lable throughout the evening.\n\nEnjoy 25–30 minutes at each venue - a d
 ynamic experience which offers the perfect opportunity to explore familiar
  favorites while mingling with fellow members along the way.\n\n*This even
 t is offered at $72 per member\, plus tax\, and is available to members on
 ly. Club fees are included in the price of the ticket. Cancellations made 
