 -only. Set aside for those looking to expand their social circle over a sh
 ared meal\, this gathering is all about good food\, lively conversation\, 
 and meaningful connections. Pull up a chair\, and savor the experience—b
 ecause nothing brings people together quite like a great meal.\n\n*This ev
 ent is reserved for members only. An advance charge of $24 per member cont
 ributes to communal appetizers available upon seating. Members are respons
 ible for à la carte entrées\, desserts\, and beverages\, plus taxes and 
 fees. Cancellations made within 24 hours of the event\, or failure to atte
 nd will be subject to the Café Q's surcharge policy.
