DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260626T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260626T180000
SUMMARY:'Quin Suite: World Cup France v. Norway
LOCATION:Offsite: Gillette Stadium
DESCRIPTION:Category: Sports & Games\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: Waitl
 ist Only\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/175300\n\nSec
