 76\n\nIn anticipation of America's 250th anniversary\, members are invited
  to experience Boston's revolutionary history through an exclusive guided 
 tour hosted by Revolutionary Spaces. The afternoon will begin with a welco
 me and introduction from President and CEO Dr. Nathaniel Sheidley before e
 xploring some of the city's most significant historic landmarks\, includin
 g the Old State House and Old South Meeting House.\n\nAlong the way\, memb
 ers will gain deeper insight into the events\, people\, and ideas that sha
 ped the nation's founding through guided access to permanent exhibitions a
 nd historic spaces. The experience will conclude with rare private access 
 to the Old State House Clock Tower and Old South Meeting House Clock Tower
 \, offering a unique perspective on two of Boston's most iconic landmarks.
 \n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for members only.
