BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-191166@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260709T160000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260709T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260709T180000
SUMMARY:Meet the Maker: Berene Sauls of Tesselaarsdal Wines
LOCATION:The Muse
DESCRIPTION:Category: Food & Beverage\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 40 spots 
 left\nStatus: futureSale\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/even
 ts/191166\n\nJoin us for an evening of wine\, storytelling\, and discovery
  as we welcome Berene Sauls\, founder and winemaker of Tesselaarsdal Wines
 \, for an intimate reception-style Meet the Maker.\n\nBorn in the historic
  South African village of Tesselaarsdal and inspired by its remarkable leg
 acy\, Berene has emerged as one of the country's most compelling voices in
  modern winemaking. Her journey—from working behind the scenes at the ac
 claimed Hamilton Russell Vineyards to launching her own label in 2015—ha
 s been guided by a commitment to honoring place\, heritage\, and the trans
 formative power of opportunity.\n\nThroughout the evening\, members will e
 njoy a guided tasting of two vintages each of Tesselaarsdal Chardonnay and
  Pinot Noir\, exploring the distinctive terroir of the Hemel-en-Aarde Ridg
 e and the stories woven into every bottle. As Berene shares her experience
 s as a pioneering female winemaker and entrepreneur\, guests will gain a d
 eeper appreciation for the people\, history\, and landscape shaping one of
  South Africa's most exciting wine regions.\n\n*This event is complimenary
  and reserved for members only. Complimentary light bites and refreshments
  will be served.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/191166
CATEGORIES:Food & Beverage
END:VEVENT
