 eet before the evening culminates with a spectacular fireworks display ill
 uminating the Boston skyline.\n\nThroughout the cruise\, guests will enjoy
  an open bar and a selection of elevated bites while taking in one of the 
 most anticipated events of the Semiquincentennial celebration from the bes
 t seat in the harbor.\n\n*This event is offered at $295 per person and i
